{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "3b1c2e3eb6c260be1df8020ad3f7e1d600c3fcc26ebe2bce1022c3a170bad7c2", "ja": "ライブMC　～空の彼方へ、歌声を！～", "zh": "演唱会MC ～将歌声传向天空彼方！～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7660e11299ad41f616dbafacfa1dbd941b7aba6d91ba776dded62d2564c150c5", "ja": "パフォーマンスを終えた真、麗花、このみ、\n桃子。どこまでも飛べそうな開放感に、麗花\nは本当にステージから飛び立とうとする。一\n同は麗花を止めながらも、気持ちはわかると\n言い、続く歌声を空に解き放つのだった。", "zh": "结束表演的真、丽花和好美。丽花沉浸在仿佛能飞向无尽远方的解放感中，真的打算从舞台上飞出去。众人一边阻止丽花，一边表示能够理解她的心情，随后将歌声释放到天空中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "617c69d595220135b07beccb402e12dc37ec6daf73183ff940b30d4106e79c42", "ja": "みんな！　熱いコール、ありがとう！\nボクたちのパフォーマンス、どうだったかな！？", "zh": "大家！谢谢你们热烈的应援！\n我们的表演，大家觉得怎么样啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1001_audience", "source_sha256": "c385c711500e905717b0c668b7071dbf38e6f0f6068c7ac856003a33674461c2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "1bb3b34e59b2421780a7e86c738ae9365119d8628750c481d492b544f7d4c0b8", "ja": "わあ、すごく大きな声！　空の下だから\nどこまでも響いて飛んでいっちゃいそうだね♪", "zh": "哇，好大声啊！因为是在蓝天之下，\n感觉声音能一直传到很远很远的地方去呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "578d5958038742cd1b58b437614f4fe1423a1fa85fc27f6ac2361dfaa05a79fe", "ja": "外で歌うのって、伸び伸びしててすごく\n気持ちいいわよね～。桃子ちゃんはどうだった？", "zh": "在户外唱歌，不仅能放得开，而且感觉\n特别舒畅呢～桃子觉得怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "5bbebfbb4bc151653d039759ea7d6e3ba983ec21832c4595bcdbcc9c87476a79", "ja": "桃子もすっごく楽しいよ。それにステージからの眺めも\nキレイだよね。みんなにも見せてあげたいぐらい。", "zh": "桃子也觉得特别开心。而且从舞台上看到的景色也很漂亮，甚至想让大家也看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "54b5870b40a4e78dbd3385b3a0fd7eaf8e66da2a41bb4ca03854ab2db94d81f5", "ja": "そうだね。でも、それができない分、みんなには\nボクたちのパフォーマンスをたくさん見てもらおうよ！", "zh": "对啊。不过既然没法让大家看到景色，那就让大家多看看我们的精彩表演吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "b286b27eeb69b806f2f54dff323271a9adca04c6ec3b9a059fe0ca7c398deb8f", "ja": "そうそう、それに、せっかくの野外ステージだもの。\nみんな、私の開放感あふれるアダルティを感じてね♪", "zh": "对对，而且难得是在户外舞台。\n大家一定要感受我那充满自由气息的成熟魅力哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1007_audience", "source_sha256": "c385c711500e905717b0c668b7071dbf38e6f0f6068c7ac856003a33674461c2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "16df8b287ec2268e3826908be81ad4df3d28b44294c7ba08848dff911f3908a9", "ja": "……あれ？　麗花さん、どうしたの？\nずっと空を眺めてるけど……。", "zh": "……咦？丽花姐，你怎么了？\n一直在眺望天空……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "996460469be7fd6ac3bb15c578bfdf3c02103406553470b9e2ba7630fd403bce", "ja": "あのね、みんなの声も、私たちの歌も、\nすぅ～って空の上に届いてるでしょ？", "zh": "那个啊，大家的声音也好，我们的歌声也好，\n不都是“咻——”地传到了天空中嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1010_048rei", "source_sha256": "fe3014ff393e47ddd7ef735de4122554f79ada38380c96f4ca022325956cae54", "ja": "だから、このまま体ごと飛んでいけたらいいのになぁ、\nって思って！　えへへ♪", "zh": "所以我就想，要是能就这样连身体一起飞上去就好了……！嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "005a99f043a20360a1eb9c0ba3f23bb8479b24e498458f4944f0a9962941444f", "ja": "気持ちはわかるけど……って麗花ちゃんストップ！\n行かないの！　ステージの縁は危ないわよ！", "zh": "我能理解你的心情……不过丽花，停下！别过去！舞台边缘很危险！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "0867d5dc80fc7b741df25cc6fddf819103c95820e2e4bf7b02a9ff91ace370f5", "ja": "もう……。\nでも、麗花さんの気持ち、ちょっとわかるかも。", "zh": "真是的……\n不过，我好像有点理解丽花小姐的心情了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "071e1d7c5217f657194083a437b5047291e5751a304a619149a696eae2ca9ba5", "ja": "うん。今日はなんだか、どこまでも飛んで行けそうな、\nそんな気分だよね！", "zh": "嗯。今天总觉得好像能飞去任何地方，\n就是这种心情呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "a5ca9a45bec3fe42a61862feb597f8b415aa6e5c93c7683187a2846a9c845b57", "ja": "でも、今はこのステージの上から、歌声だけを飛ばして\nいこう！　次の曲、いっくよーーー！！", "zh": "不过现在，就让歌声从这个舞台上飞向远方吧！下一首歌，要开始啦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_04_1015_audience", "source_sha256": "c385c711500e905717b0c668b7071dbf38e6f0f6068c7ac856003a33674461c2", "ja": "ワアアアアアアア！！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
